  "notes": [
    "Regular -IR verb — follows standard -IR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *escurrido* (regular)",
    "Means \"to drain\" (dishes, pasta) or \"to wring out\" (wet clothes) — *escurre los platos* (drain the dishes), *escurrir la ropa mojada* (to wring out the wet clothes)",
    "Reflexive *escurrirse* means \"to slip\" or \"to slip away/sneak off\": *se escurrió entre la multitud* (he/she slipped away through the crowd)",
    "Related: *escurridor* (colander, dish rack), *escurridizo/a* (slippery, elusive)"
  ],
